  "name": "binance-top50-spot-v1",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tBinance Top 50 Backtesting Dataset\n\t\n\nBuilt at: 2026-05-21T11:53:45.468482+00:00\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tParameters\n\t\n\n\nLookback: 1 days\nTop N: 3\nTrade Types: spot, um\nData Types: klines, aggTrades\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tBuild Status\n\t\n\n\nSPOT: 3 symbols\nklines: 3/3 healthy\naggTrades: 3/3 healthy\n\n\nUM: 3 symbols\nklines: 3/3 healthy\naggTrades: 3/3 healthy\nfundingRate: 3/3 healthy\n\n\n\n",
